=== how an item is spelled
a file                 "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/img.jpg"   leaf=img.jpg   file
a folder               "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/"          leaf=trip      dir
the root               "tsync/home/manifests/"                      leaf=          dir
a top-level file       "tsync/home/manifests/notes.txt"             leaf=notes.txt file

=== the path a journal entry records
a file                 "photos/trip/img.jpg"
a folder               "photos/trip"
the root               ""

=== what an item sits in
a file                 "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/"
a folder               "tsync/home/manifests/photos/"
a top-level file       "tsync/home/manifests/"
the root               "tsync/home/manifests/"

=== descending
into a folder          "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/img.jpg"
from the root          "tsync/home/manifests/notes.txt"
a folder in a folder   "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/raw/"

=== what a folder offers and a file does not
list a folder          "tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/"
list a file            refused
descend into a file    refused

=== back from the wire
"tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/img.jpg"     file "photos/trip/img.jpg"
"tsync/home/manifests/photos/trip/"            dir "photos/trip"
"tsync/home/manifests/"                        dir ""
"tsync/work/manifests/img.jpg"                 not this domain's
"img.jpg"                                      not this domain's

=== two items of one name
file and folder equal  false
a leading separator    true
